{"id":2621,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2026年4月10日，经济与管理学院心理辅导站于教室15102成功举办十佳心灵守护天使评选暨心理委员答辩活动，24级、25级全体心理委员参与，到场共一百余人。活动以主持人报幕与开场舞启幕，现场氛围热烈欢快。答辩环节按年级有序开展，25级大一心理委员围绕班级心理工作推进、心理知识普及、同学情绪疏导等重点内容详细汇报，充分展现出认真履职、主动担当的良好风貌；24级大二心理委员则结合自身积累的工作经验，全面分享工作成果、实践感悟及后续改进思路，生动彰显了服务意识与责任担当。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tLR7jYMzVkL47PMw7M2L8-aUmLanRfXfU4lsozNZU8QVozC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhkM1hkUSyDL4NPn7nVnlnVnm6RL4A2oz7ZnzCPozCZnlMFnNCZnRGaLRMFMRNYnzGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-4MRlbgtA8pU/cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=23459&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3B6BA6391DDEEDEF7C38F918E61968EC/FF8D0003/492E0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 443px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tLR7jYMzVkL47PMw7M2L8-aUmLanRfXfU4lsozNZU8QVozC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhkM1hkUSyDL4NPn7nVnlnVnm6RL4A2oz7ZnzCPozCZnlMFnNCZnRGaLRMFMRNYnzGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-4MRlbgtA8pU/cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=23459&e=.png\"></p><p>十佳心理委员获奖名单：2509024107高宇昕、2509044206窦思楠、2509014206杜灿灿、2509044105张仪、2509024322张思雨、2409054115雷浩然、2409034206任鸿茜、2405054317艾比白·艾散江、2409024220戴美林、2409044243杨一凡。活动现场随即举行颁奖仪式，分批次为大一、大二获奖心理委员颁发荣誉证书，现场氛围热烈、掌声连连。本次活动不仅检验了心理委员的工作成效，进一步激发了大家的工作热情与责任担当，也夯实了学院心理健康教育工作的基层队伍力量。未来，经济与管理学院心理辅导站将持续深耕心理健康教育，完善心理委员培养体系，开展更多护航活动，筑牢学子心理健康防护网。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tM8MjVUzWkMmMVLwmN8U4rkU87sLl7X4nNlsUz7sMmM7LR90gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysUYhRnSyDU4f2Um7iLz-bnlMfU8-ZnzUYLRTkM49YM8VFM46fLzTVozfFM7CYLzLJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-4MRlbgtA8pU/cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=23459&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/67CCE6C0FB15129ECACB8E4209B7827A/77A19E90/4F213\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tM8MjVUzWkMmMVLwmN8U4rkU87sLl7X4nNlsUz7sMmM7LR90gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysUYhRnSyDU4f2Um7iLz-bnlMfU8-ZnzUYLRTkM49YM8VFM46fLzTVozfFM7CYLzLJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-4MRlbgtA8pU/cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=23459&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tLR7jYMzVkL47PMw7M2L8-aUmLanRfXfU4lsozNZU8QVozC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhkM1hkUSyDL4NPn7nVnlnVnm6RL4A2oz7ZnzCPozCZnlMFnNCZnRGaLRMFMRNYnzGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-4MRlbgtA8pU/cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=23459&e=.png"}